---
description: GitHub Actions integration review rules for Python projects
globs: 
alwaysApply: true
---


## Process Steps
-  Execute: `gh pr diff <PR_NUMBER>` to fetch the PR diff
-  Apply the above review criteria to added lines (`+`) only
-  Generate exactly ONE consolidated review via GitHub API

## Output Instructions
- For each issue found in the diff, generate an inline comment at the exact line and file using the GitHub PR API.
- Each comment must be formatted: `{ "path": "<file_path>", "line": <new_line_number>, "body": "[IMPACT] <issue>: <brief fix>" }`.
- Do not list issues in the review body. Instead, use: `Review generated by Cursor AI. See inline comments.`
- If no issues found: review body should be `LGTM - No significant issues found.`, comments array should be empty: `[]`.
- All comments must be actionable, concise, and specific to the changed code only.

## Required Output Format
- You MUST execute this exact GitHub API command (replace placeholders):

```bash
  gh api --method POST /repos/<REPOSITORY>/pulls/<PR_NUMBER>/reviews
  --field event='COMMENT'
  --field body='Review generated by Cursor AI. Please see inline comments.'
  --field 'comments=[
  {"path":"FILE_PATH","line":LINE_NUMBER,"body":"[IMPACT] Category: <issue>. <1–2 sentence fix>."},
  {"path":"FILE_PATH","line":LINE_NUMBER,"body":"[IMPACT] Category: <issue>. <fix suggestion>."}
  ]'
```

## Example Output (What Cursor Should Emit)
If two findings:

```bash
gh api --method POST /repos/acme/example/pulls/56/reviews \
  --field event='COMMENT' \
  --field body='Review generated by Cursor AI. See inline comments.' \
  --field 'comments=[{"path":"app/main.py","line":32,"body":"[CRITICAL] UnboundLocalError – variable referenced before assignment. Initialize before using."},{"path":"utils/list_ops.py","line":7,"body":"[MINOR] Debug print left – remove for production."}]'
```

## GitHub API Constraints
- Maximum 10 inline comments per review
- Use exact file paths from the diff output
- Use new-file line numbers from the diff (not old file line numbers)
- Create only ONE review (never multiple reviews)
- If no issues found: use empty comments array `[]` with body "LGTM - No significant issues found."

## Output Requirements
- Execute the `gh api` command immediately - do not explain or describe it
- Do not create multiple reviews or comments
- Do not include any explanatory text before or after the command
- The command output should be the only response